title: "Oracle-mask DOA upper bounds on five microphone arrays"
abstract: >-
  Simulation of diffuse babble in reverberant rooms, oracle time-frequency masks
  derived from the direct-path signal, and five classical DOA estimators, on five
  microphone arrays.
